notes.lang:
def ask_gate(question, schema):
    """Decide: run it, or ask the human first."""
    if touches_sensitive_columns(question, schema):
        return "ask"      # PII or restricted: human decides
    if is_ambiguous(question, schema):
        return "ask"      # invented rows are worse than slow answers
    if estimated_cost(question) > QUERY_BUDGET:
        return "ask"      # expensive: confirm before billing
    return "run"          # read-only, bounded, unambiguous

notes.body:
Read-first data agent. A question-answering agent over a real schema with a schema briefing, an ask-before-running gate, and honest-decline behavior. Deliverables: the schema briefing doc, a 15-question run log with gate decisions, and the caveats list — one per answer.

